# Spock, Voice of Reason: "{2}, {T}: Draw a card for each nontoken permanent you control that entered this turn." On turn 3
# Bot1 plays an Island and casts Savannah Lions, and Secure the Wastes makes a Warrior token: two of those three entered
# this turn under Bot1 and are nontoken, so Bot1 draws exactly two - the token is not counted (CR 111.1) and neither is
# Bot2's Forest, which entered this turn but is not Bot1's. The moxen and Spock entered on turn 1 and are not counted
# either. On turn 5 nothing entered this turn, so the same activation draws none: "this turn" is the turn of the
# activation.

